ill have the potential to transform medicine and improve patient outcomes. We have developed the RaniPill capsule, which is our novel, proprietary and patented platform technology, intended to replace subcutaneous or IV injection of biologics with oral dosing. The RaniPill capsule is an orally ingestible pill approximately the size of a \u201c000\u201d capsule (or similar to the size of a standard fish oil or calcium pill) that is designed to automatically administer a precise therapeutic dose of medication upon deployment in the small intestine. To date, we have successfully conducted several preclinical and clinical studies to evaluate safety, tolerability and bioavailability using the RaniPill capsule. Our development efforts have enabled us to construct an extensive intellectual property portfolio that we believe provides us a competitive advantage.\n</p></div>\n      \n</div>\n      \n  </div>\n</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-6 radix-layouts-column2 panel-panel\">\n        <div  class=\"panel-panel-inner\">\n          <div class=\"block-region-column2\"><div data-storage-id=\"node:5806:full:13751\" data-uuid=\"ef6147b4-5c48-4bb5-a249-efadc198f426\" class=\"block--market-data-block__stock-quote block--market-data-block__stock-quote--5806 block--column2--market-data-block__stock-quote block--column2--market-data-block__stock-quote--5806 block--ef6147b4-5c48-4bb5-a249-efadc198f426 block--ef6147b4-5c48-4bb5-a249-efadc198f426--5806 block block-nir-market-data-block block-market-data-block__stock-quote\">\n  \n    \n      <div class='quote-wrap user-toggle-off stock-quote__featured'>\n  <div class=\"quote-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"stock-quote\" data-exchange=\"\">\n\n      <div class=\"exchange\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"quote-price \"></div>\n\n        <dd>Change</dd><dt class=\"\"></dt>\n\n        <dd>Volume</dd><dt></dt>\n\n        \n    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n<div class=\"block--nir